plaintext
* Components
V1 5 2 DC Vin
V2 3 2 DC Vos
R1 2 21 R1
R2 21 0 R2
* Voltage Controlled Voltage Source for Op-Amp (ideal op-amp)
E1 2 0 5 3 A0
* Notes
* Node 2 is the non-inverting input of the op-amp
* Node 21 is connected between R1 and R2
* Node 5 and 3 are the inputs for Vin and Vos respectively
* Node 0 is the ground